Neuroimaging studies

07:28.880 --> 07:30.320
could explore neural correlates

07:30.320 --> 07:31.080
of earworms,

07:31.180 --> 07:32.300
examining how recursive

07:32.300 --> 07:33.000
cognitive loops

07:33.000 --> 07:34.440
activate reward circuits.

07:35.140 --> 07:35.680
These approaches

07:35.680 --> 07:36.660
would test the hypothesis

07:36.660 --> 07:37.860
that structural features

07:37.860 --> 07:38.700
drive propagation

07:38.700 --> 07:40.960
independent of epistemic merit.

07:42.460 --> 07:43.680
6. Additional domains

07:43.680 --> 07:44.760
of recursive propagation.

07:45.720 --> 07:48.220
6.1. Biological systems.

07:49.440 --> 07:51.320
Viruses, prions, and cancer cells

07:51.320 --> 07:52.500
exhibit recursive propagation.

07:52.500 --> 07:53.520
For example,

07:53.860 --> 07:55.040
viral proteins act as

07:55.040 --> 07:56.180
counterfoil stubs,

07:56.600 --> 07:57.460
ensuring replication

07:57.460 --> 07:59.260
by hijacking cellular machinery.

07:59.980 --> 08:00.800
Prions propagate

08:00.800 --> 08:02.140
by inducing misfolding

08:02.140 --> 08:03.060
in other proteins,

08:03.520 --> 08:04.340
a recursive loop

08:04.340 --> 08:05.620
akin to memetic spread.

08:06.320 --> 08:07.780
Cancer cells sustain growth

08:07.780 --> 08:08.820
through autocatalytic

08:08.820 --> 08:09.820
signaling pathways,

08:10.060 --> 08:10.560
mirroring the

08:10.560 --> 08:12.160
mutual generation criterion.

08:13.300 --> 08:14.940
6.2. Economic systems.

08:15.620 --> 08:16.300
Ponzi schemes

08:16.300 --> 08:17.960
and cryptocurrency hype cycles

08:17.960 --> 08:19.380
operate as autocatalytic

08:19.380 --> 08:20.120
financial loops.

08:20.840 --> 08:21.680
In Ponzi schemes,

08:21.840 --> 08:22.460
early payouts

08:22.460 --> 08:23.800
catalyze further investment,

08:24.360 --> 08:26.100
creating a self-reinforcing cycle

08:26.100 --> 08:27.080
until collapse.

08:27.400 --> 08:28.760
Cryptocurrency markets propagate

08:28.760 --> 08:30.000
through speculative feedback

08:30.000 --> 08:31.780
where hype generates more hype,

08:31.960 --> 08:33.640
aligning with the essay's criteria

08:33.640 --> 08:34.760
of mutual generation

08:34.760 --> 08:35.780
and internal persistence.

08:38.460 --> 08:41.020
6.3. Social media algorithms.

08:41.960 --> 08:42.940
Recommendation algorithms

08:42.940 --> 08:44.800
create recursive content loops

08:44.800 --> 08:45.960
by amplifying attention

08:45.960 --> 08:46.960
to salient items,

08:47.180 --> 08:48.120
forming echo chambers

08:48.120 --> 08:49.560
that mirror memetic propagation.

08:50.500 --> 08:51.580
These systems exhibit

08:51.580 --> 08:52.900
resistance to termination

08:52.900 --> 08:54.520
as user engagement

08:54.520 --> 08:56.280
reinforces algorithmic bias,

08:56.400 --> 08:57.040
sustaining loops

08:57.040 --> 08:58.280
without external validation.

08:59.800 --> 09:02.000
6.4. Political movements.

09:02.460 --> 09:03.500
Ideological frameworks,

09:03.760 --> 09:05.180
such as populist narratives,

09:05.620 --> 09:06.680
persist through recursive

09:06.680 --> 09:07.240
reinforcement

09:07.240 --> 09:08.340
and contrastive framing,

09:08.920 --> 09:10.040
e.g. us versus them

09:10.040 --> 09:11.840
as a Calabari counterfoil choice.

09:12.440 --> 09:13.580
These movements propagate

09:13.580 --> 09:14.740
by embedding instructions

09:14.740 --> 09:15.900
for their own continuation,

09:16.180 --> 09:17.460
leveraging emotional salience

09:17.460 --> 09:18.500
and social identity.

09:19.920 --> 09:21.820
7. Philosophical dimensions

09:21.820 --> 09:23.020
of recursive systems.

09:23.020 --> 09:24.780
The recursive framework

09:24.780 --> 09:27.060
raises profound philosophical questions.

09:27.980 --> 09:28.720
The tension between

09:28.720 --> 09:29.780
structural persistence

09:29.780 --> 09:30.960
and epistemic value

09:30.960 --> 09:32.240
challenges traditional notions

09:32.240 --> 09:33.000
of truth-seeking.

09:33.880 --> 09:35.620
If cognition prioritizes

09:35.620 --> 09:36.840
stickiness over validity,

09:37.420 --> 09:39.080
what distinguishes meaningful ideas

09:39.080 --> 09:40.200
from mere earworms?

09:40.780 --> 09:42.420
This suggests a view of cognition

09:42.420 --> 09:43.960
as an autocatalytic arena

09:43.960 --> 09:45.860
where agency competes

09:45.860 --> 09:46.860
with recursive loops,

09:47.200 --> 09:48.560
potentially undermining free will.

09:49.440 --> 09:50.700
Connections to Buddhist

09:50.700 --> 09:52.060
dependent origination

09:52.060 --> 09:53.420
where phenomena co-arise

09:53.420 --> 09:54.580
through mutual causation

09:54.580 --> 09:57.060
and Hindu cyclical time,

09:57.200 --> 09:57.640
samsara,

09:58.300 --> 09:59.180
situate the framework

09:59.180 --> 10:00.560
in global philosophical traditions,

10:01.000 --> 10:01.820
highlighting recursion

10:01.820 --> 10:02.820
as a universal principle

10:02.820 --> 10:03.600
of existence.

10:04.260 --> 10:06.220
7.1. Historical perspectives

10:06.220 --> 10:07.700
on recursive propagation.

10:08.660 --> 10:09.300
Historically,

10:09.520 --> 10:10.960
recursive systems are evident

10:10.960 --> 10:12.940
in persistent cultural practices.

10:13.880 --> 10:15.200
Oral storytelling traditions

10:15.200 --> 10:16.940
embed recursive structures,

10:17.260 --> 10:18.840
e.g. repeated motifs

10:18.840 --> 10:20.560
in epics that ensure transmission

10:20.560 --> 10:21.660
across generations.

10:22.460 --> 10:23.700
Religious dogmas propagate

10:23.700 --> 10:25.560
through self-referential doctrines

10:25.560 --> 10:27.180
akin to counterfoil stubs.

10:27.700 --> 10:28.660
Technological shifts

10:28.660 --> 10:30.000
such as the printing press

10:30.000 --> 10:30.600
or internet

10:30.600 --> 10:31.920
alter the substrates

10:31.920 --> 10:33.000
for recursive systems,

10:33.180 --> 10:34.260
amplifying their reach

10:34.260 --> 10:35.540
while preserving their logic.

10:36.980 --> 10:37.600
Hector 8.

10:38.060 --> 10:39.920
Implications for Cognition and Language.

10:40.920 --> 10:41.900
Language may be viewed

10:41.900 --> 10:43.540
as a self-perpetuating system,

10:43.740 --> 10:45.360
akin to an autocatalytic set,

10:45.360 --> 10:46.360
or EM wave,

10:46.820 --> 10:48.140
where recursive grammars,

10:48.280 --> 10:49.020
memetic selection,

10:49.180 --> 10:50.480
and cognitive earworms

10:50.480 --> 10:51.440
ensure continuity.

10:52.260 --> 10:53.280
The Zettelkasten method,

10:53.500 --> 10:54.500
recursive AI prompts,

10:54.600 --> 10:55.420
and viral slogans

10:55.420 --> 10:56.240
illustrate this.

10:57.080 --> 10:58.000
Ideas survive

10:58.000 --> 10:58.940
because they replicate,

10:59.280 --> 11:00.400
not because they clarify.

11:01.240 --> 11:02.280
The metaphor of language

11:02.280 --> 11:03.620
as a cognitive infection

11:03.620 --> 11:05.060
is evocative

11:05.060 --> 11:06.300
but risks tautology

11:06.300 --> 11:07.760
as any replicating system,

11:07.900 --> 11:09.040
e.g. gravity chemistry,

11:09.520 --> 11:10.780
could be labeled an infection.

11:11.780 --> 11:12.140
Instead,

11:12.360 --> 11:13.560
we propose that cognition

11:13.560 --> 11:14.280
is an arena

11:14.280 --> 11:16.020
for competing recursive systems

11:16.020 --> 11:16.840
where memes

11:16.840 --> 11:18.060
like the song that doesn't end

11:18.060 --> 11:18.940
persist through

11:18.940 --> 11:20.160
structural stickiness

11:20.160 --> 11:21.960
rather than epistemic merit.

11:23.380 --> 11:24.220
8.1.

11:24.480 --> 11:26.360
Applications of recursive propagation

11:26.360 --> 11:27.940
insights from this framework

11:27.940 --> 11:29.920
can inform practical applications.

11:30.760 --> 11:32.120
Beneficial recursive systems

11:32.120 --> 11:33.560
such as educational memes

11:33.560 --> 11:34.880
or public health campaigns

